    <title>Vol.007 理想 AI 眼镜 Livis 上市点评：克制与野望</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6932c63b4ef12f9fe9195579</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6932c63b4ef12f9fe9195579</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 11:58:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期播客是专题内容：理想 AI 眼镜 Livis 上市点评。音质不好请大家谅解。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5Bzlx_hKD-GcjnX1m87GQaQ1EF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>重点话题：</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> 产品初印象</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> Livis 的续航究竟行不行</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a> 第一卖点「快」和背后的国产芯片</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> 眼镜盒充与换电哪种体验更好</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> AI 智能眼镜如何做产品定义</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a> AI 眼镜的真实需求和价值排序</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3223">53:43</a> AI 眼镜的 AI 有什么用？</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3672">01:01:12</a> 理想为什么坚持要做 AI 眼镜</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4432">01:13:52</a> Livis 独有的车控功能</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4872">01:21:12</a> AI 眼镜可能是 AI Device 最终胜出产品形态</span><br><span>◉ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5247">01:27:27</a> 创业公司在 AI 眼镜市场的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span>谈内容都属于主播个人观点，不客观不公正。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>主播/制作人：于欣烈</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>嘉宾主播：</span><br><span>◦ 李楠｜怒喵科技 CEO、播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6727411d33c798676f0d4d44" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6727411d33c798676f0d4d44"><span>《AI 谬论》</span></a><span>主播</span><br><span>◦ 小特叔叔｜电动汽车博主</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>邮件：</span><a href="mailto:mail@yuxinlie.com"><span>mail@yuxinlie.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
