    <guid isPermaLink="false">6468c81253a5e5ea14952558</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 May 2023 13:16:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>看完特斯拉 2023 股东大会，我和郑小康聊了聊新车型、FSD、AI、Tesla Bot、商业模式等等我们感兴趣的内容。</span></p><ul><li><p><span>主播：于欣烈</span></p></li><li><p><span>嘉宾：类星频道创始人 郑小康（微博 @不是郑小康）</span></p></li><li><p><span>制作：于欣烈</span></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 整体印象</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">08:21</a> Cybertruck</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> Roadster 2.0</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> FSD 跳票问题、产品定义</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 理想城区道路 NOA</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2695">44:55</a> 新车型</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">48:15</a> 降本能力背后的底层逻辑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">61:50</a> AI 和体系能力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4210">70:10</a> Robotaxi 的质疑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4340">72:20</a> 马斯克的选择</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4608">76:48</a> 为什么做广告</span></p><p><span>欢迎大家多写评论一起讨论。</span></p><p><span>我的专栏：</span><a href="https://xiaobot.net/p/SmartEV" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/SmartEV"><span>《智能电动汽车商业分析》</span></a></p><p><span>邮件：mail@yuxinlie.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmIQ_Wg-U2lfDLp9_79MOvm8-P1u.m4a" length="78131807" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnBhmqUxGjXlI_60Tp1NhPllQ7Qh.png"/>
