    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你好，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我会用两期节目和你聊聊微软如何成为了全球第三大游戏公司，如何升维与索尼、任天堂竞争。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年1月，微软花了687亿美元现金，收购动视暴雪。我观察到大多数人对微软还留在一个刻板印象 —— 被谷歌、苹果按在地板反复摩擦的、移动互联网时代的失败者。而微软去年一度超过苹果成为全球市值最高上市公司。</span></p><span></span><p><span>恰好节前我看了一部 Xbox 纪录片，讲了很多内幕故事，很好看，也引发了我很多好奇。我会通过游戏这个业务，给你讲一讲微软这几年来发生了什么变化，梳理一下微软 Xbox 游戏业务背后的商业逻辑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>评论、邮件、即刻……期待你的任何反馈，我会及时回复。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的主播</span><br><span>于欣烈</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：ibabawu@gmail.com</span><br><span>即刻：@于欣烈</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>订阅 叭叭呜 专栏 Newsletter</span></strong><br><span>定期发送播客通讯、商业故事、案例分析，不提供播客节目的完整版文字稿。</span><br><span>邮箱、微信都可订阅。</span><br><span>链接：</span><a href="https://babawu.zhubai.love/" data-url="https://babawu.zhubai.love/"><span>babawu.zhubai.love</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容提要</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a> </span></strong><span>DirectX 4人组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 大牛 Nat Brown 加入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="548">09:08</a> 微软游戏工作室负责人 Ed Fries</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 索尼向微软宣战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> D小组 KO WinCE</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 挑战鲍尔默</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a> 害怕制造硬件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> 不装 Windows？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 情人节评审会盖茨暴怒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> 收购 Bungie</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2776">46:16</a> 乔布斯八卦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2969">49:29</a> Xbox 正式发布</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3160">52:40</a> 商业分析 - 社会环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3289">54:49</a> 商业分析 - SPW（Something People Want）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3656">1:00:56</a> 商业分析 - 产品力三角形</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片头</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>记者：你想过制造硬件设备吗？</span><br><span>盖茨：不，我们决定不做硬件。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片尾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>第一代 Xbox 开机音效</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目推荐内容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>望岳投资南添的公众号：南添的求真之路</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xbox.com/en-US/power-on#watch" data-url="https://www.xbox.com/en-US/power-on#watch"><span>Power On: The Story of Xbox</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RM4y1F7oo" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RM4y1F7oo"><span>启动：Xbox 的故事</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我的专栏：</span><a href="https://xiaobot.net/p/SmartEV" data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/SmartEV"><span>《智能电动汽车商业分析》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>邮件：</span><a href="mailto:mail@yuxinlie.com"><span>mail@yuxinlie.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
